  "summary": "In anatomy, each neuron in the human brain is estimated to connect to 10,000 others.  \nIn philosophy, Lao Zi writes about ten thousand things in the Tao Te Ching.  \nIn Zen Buddhism, the \"10,000 Things\" is a term meaning all of phenomenal reality.",
  "content_html": "<h1>10,000</h1>\n<div class=\"docsViewer__summary\"><p>In anatomy, each neuron in the human brain is estimated to connect to 10,000 others.  <br>\nIn philosophy, Lao Zi writes about ten thousand things in the Tao Te Ching.  <br>\nIn Zen Buddhism, the &quot;10,000 Things&quot; is a term meaning all of phenomenal reality.</p></div>\n<figure class=\"docsViewerFigure docsViewerFigure--image-left\" data-docs-content-detail=\"media\" data-docs-media-kind=\"catalogue-work\" data-docs-media-id=\"00635\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"docsViewer__mediaImageLink docsViewerFigure__imageLink\" data-docs-media-open aria-label=\"Open 10,000 (1) in Media View\"><img data-docs-media-image alt=\"10,000 (1)\" hidden title=\"10,000 (1)\"><span data-docs-media-placeholder>10,000 (1)</span></button><figcaption><span class=\"docsViewerFigure__caption\">10,000 (1)</span><span class=\"docsViewerFigure__metadata\">2009<br>digital c-type print<br>50 × 50 cm<br>cat. 00635</span></figcaption></figure>\n<h3>what will become of the 10,000?</h3>\n<p>10,000 photographs of people, reduced to dots of light. have all these souls become equal, points on a uniform grid? some are missing… what has happened to these lost souls?</p>\n<p>dots of colour are not an artifact, but an archetype. all art is something that reinvents, rediscovers. we already have the answers within us, and in the process of realising the self (potential) we come across patterns and images that seem as if they are shared. perhaps they are shared because we all share common ancestors. colour pictures (arrangements of flat colours in grids) express our collective need to be part of a group, a community, reconciled with the fact that we are individuals, and alone. there is a space between the dots: this space is part of our nature and also part of the problem that we need to solve.</p>\n<p>perhaps it was inevitable, that souls could be abstracted to pixels; an impossibility that is a partial definition of art. but the picture has to be done, not thinking that it is an end to something… and so it often seems to me that there is no attainment of peace in art.</p>\n<p>Feb 2008</p>\n<p>if we isolate a particle, we find that it composed of smaller particles:</p>\n<figure class=\"docsViewerFigure docsViewerFigure--image-left\" data-docs-content-detail=\"media\" data-docs-media-kind=\"catalogue-work\" data-docs-media-id=\"03181\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"docsViewer__mediaImageLink docsViewerFigure__imageLink\" data-docs-media-open aria-label=\"Open 10,000 (1.3) in Media View\"><img data-docs-media-image alt=\"10,000 (1.3)\" hidden title=\"10,000 (1.3)\"><span data-docs-media-placeholder>10,000 (1.3)</span></button><figcaption><span class=\"docsViewerFigure__caption\">10,000 (1.3)</span></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"docsViewerFigure docsViewerFigure--image-right\" data-docs-content-detail=\"media\" data-docs-media-kind=\"catalogue-work\" data-docs-media-id=\"04625\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"docsViewer__mediaImageLink docsViewerFigure__imageLink\" data-docs-media-open aria-label=\"Open 10,000 (1.4) in Media View\"><img data-docs-media-image alt=\"10,000 (1.4)\" hidden title=\"10,000 (1.4)\"><span data-docs-media-placeholder>10,000 (1.4)</span></button><figcaption><span class=\"docsViewerFigure__caption\">10,000 (1.4)</span></figcaption></figure>\n<p>merging many images and their meanings into a <a href=\"?collection=concepts&amp;doc=d-20260727-225608-cfc88e\">compressed</a> form is a recurring theme, also addressed in <a href=\"?collection=works&amp;doc=d-20260801-212422-df11f3\">3 symbols</a>.</p>\n<section data-docs-related-links=\"true\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"docsViewer__inlineIcon\" data-docs-icon=\"dlf-catalogue\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.125em;background-color:currentColor;mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-image:url(data:image/svg+xml;base64,);\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip-path:inset(50%);white-space:nowrap;\">[[icon:dlf-catalogue]]</span></span> <a data-docs-related-link=\"true\" href=\"?collection=catalogue&amp;doc=00635\">10,000 (1)</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"docsViewer__inlineIcon\" data-docs-icon=\"dlf-catalogue\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.125em;background-color:currentColor;mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-image:url(data:image/svg+xml;base64,);\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip-path:inset(50%);white-space:nowrap;\">[[icon:dlf-catalogue]]</span></span> <a data-docs-related-link=\"true\" href=\"?collection=catalogue&amp;doc=03181\">10,000 (1.3)</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"docsViewer__inlineIcon\" data-docs-icon=\"dlf-catalogue\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.125em;background-color:currentColor;mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-image:url(data:image/svg+xml;base64,);\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip-path:inset(50%);white-space:nowrap;\">[[icon:dlf-catalogue]]</span></span> <a data-docs-related-link=\"true\" href=\"?collection=catalogue&amp;doc=04625\">10,000 (1.4)</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"docsViewer__inlineIcon\" data-docs-icon=\"dlf-context\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.125em;background-color:currentColor;mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-image:url(data:image/svg+xml;base64,);\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip-path:inset(50%);white-space:nowrap;\">[[icon:dlf-context]]</span></span> <a data-docs-related-link=\"true\" href=\"?collection=works&amp;doc=d-20260801-212422-df11f3\">3 symbols</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"docsViewer__inlineIcon\" data-docs-icon=\"dlf-concept\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.125em;background-color:currentColor;mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-image:url(data:image/svg+xml;base64,);\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip-path:inset(50%);white-space:nowrap;\">[[icon:dlf-concept]]</span></span> <a data-docs-related-link=\"true\" href=\"?collection=concepts&amp;doc=d-20260727-225608-cfc88e\">compressed</a></li>\n</ul></section>\n"
